        "title": "Kimai before 2.65.0 Authorization Bypass via Team Activity API",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "Kimai before 2.65.0 fails to properly validate permissions when removing team access to activities, projects, and customers via API endpoints. Authenticated users with edit_team permission can revoke team access without the required permissions_activity check, bypassing authorization controls."
          }
        ],
        "problemTypes": [
